      "id": 4350306,
      "name": "[Blueprint][Lucia] Dream Surge - Lv.50",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of Nangong Yu's exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: When using Etheric Phantom, the squad's Corruption value is greatly reduced.\nWhen Lucia upgrades a skill or uses an <color=#FFFFFF>Aftershock</color>, she gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Surge</color>, stacking up to 4 times.\nUpon exiting the <color=#FFFFFF>Dream</color> state, all <color=#FFFFFF>Surge</color> stacks will be consumed, where each consumed stack <color=#2BAD00>regenerates 10 Energy for herself</color>.",
